OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss says people fear crime
OL,4,Adespite rates
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police and crime commissioner (PCC)
OL,7,Fsaid he believed people felt there was
OL,8,Fa "sense of lawlessness" in a county
OL,9,Fwhich has one of the lowest crime rates
OL,10,Fin England.
OL,12,FReform UK's Norfolk PCC Colin Sutton
OL,13,Facknowledged the county was "very low
OL,14,Fcrime", but he highlighted shoplifting
OL,15,Fand public drug-taking in places
OL,16,Fincluding Norwich and King's Lynn.
OL,18,FThe most recent figures show thefts
OL,19,Ffrom shops and neighbourhood crimes in
OL,20,FNorfolk have fallen over the last year.
