OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss says people fear crime
OL,4,Adespite rates
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesman said it was
OL,7,Frecruiting more police and its reforms
OL,8,Fto the system would "make policing more
OL,9,Feffective".
